WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 14]

01:39.950 --> 01:41.380
Blood River kills anyone,

01:41.430 --> 01:42.330
doesn't it?

01:43.640 --> 01:45.020
I'll put

01:45.120 --> 01:46.290
the hardest man to kill

01:46.350 --> 01:47.410
before you.

01:48.150 --> 01:49.240
No need to

01:49.240 --> 01:50.060
rush your answer.

01:50.230 --> 01:51.100
Think it over and...

01:52.680 --> 01:53.330
And?

01:55.200 --> 01:56.490
If you turn your head,

01:57.790 --> 01:58.540
will it

01:58.590 --> 01:59.570
fall off?

02:06.480 --> 02:07.100
Relax.

02:08.280 --> 02:09.290
I won't kill you.

02:10.710 --> 02:11.660
Su Muyu's life

02:11.710 --> 02:12.890
is still in your hands.

02:14.590 --> 02:15.890
How could I kill you?

02:17.400 --> 02:18.010
Sir.

02:18.310 --> 02:18.980
Get lost now.

02:20.520 --> 02:21.220
Since Su Muyu

02:21.310 --> 02:22.500
is your guest,

02:23.280 --> 02:24.940
make sure you serve him fine food.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.500
He can't take spicy food.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.570
Remember that.

03:08.310 --> 03:08.730
Sir,

03:09.560 --> 03:10.450
you looked like

03:10.960 --> 03:12.010
you were going to kill him just now.

03:12.710 --> 03:13.380
Yes,

03:14.190 --> 03:15.540
I was.

03:17.560 --> 03:18.610
I almost couldn't hold back.

03:19.910 --> 03:21.060
Good thing you did.

03:22.870 --> 03:23.760
Let it be then.

03:24.470 --> 03:25.440
I hope

03:25.560 --> 03:27.130
they can treat Muyu well.

03:32.900 --> 03:34.360
[Xiao Ruofeng, Prince of Langya]

03:34.360 --> 03:35.940
Your Highness, your Drifting Swan Goose and Swallow move

03:36.520 --> 03:37.940
has improved again.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.340
It's a stealth art

03:42.080 --> 03:43.850
taught by Mr. Li.

03:45.080 --> 03:46.260
Oh, that Mr. Li.

03:51.080 --> 03:51.780
Though Mr. Li

03:52.360 --> 03:53.100
had led

03:53.150 --> 03:54.610
the best academy for years,

03:55.520 --> 03:56.260
he'd always

03:57.030 --> 03:58.820
had an unconventional spirit.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.890
Besides ordinary swordplay and martial art skills,

04:02.360 --> 04:03.890
he excelled in

04:04.030 --> 04:04.980
mystic arts

04:05.400 --> 04:06.730
and deceptive arrays.

04:08.030 --> 04:09.220
If he knew

04:09.430 --> 04:10.610
I used this method

04:10.910 --> 04:13.060
to slip past everyone and come drink here,

04:15.000 --> 04:15.660
I wonder

04:16.480 --> 04:17.780
if he'd shake his head.

04:20.070 --> 04:20.700
Your Highness,

04:22.040 --> 04:22.980
what would you like to drink?

04:24.390 --> 04:25.140
The usual?

04:28.680 --> 04:29.370
The usual.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.140
Sure.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.540
If I hadn't followed him all this way,

04:43.480 --> 04:44.660
I'd never have found him.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.170
The Prince of Langya's drinking here?

04:47.830 --> 04:48.610
Sir?

04:50.270 --> 04:51.220
You startled me.

04:52.920 --> 04:53.490
My apologies.

04:55.920 --> 04:56.810
Drinking alone

04:57.120 --> 04:58.370
at this hour,

04:58.430 --> 04:59.340
without guards

05:00.160 --> 05:01.370
or curious eyes around,

05:02.830 --> 05:03.850
that's rare.

05:26.160 --> 05:27.220
Even the finest liquor

05:27.720 --> 05:28.980
turns bitter

05:29.800 --> 05:31.050
when drunk in sorrow.

05:33.000 --> 05:33.780
Who are you?

05:36.630 --> 05:37.980
Please clear

05:38.040 --> 05:38.660
the guests outside.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.490
Go to my residence to see my butler

05:40.750 --> 05:42.050
for compensation for today's loss.

05:43.070 --> 05:43.540
Yes, Your Highness.

05:51.680 --> 05:52.980
The new Patriarch of Blood River,

05:53.720 --> 05:54.700
Su Changhe.

06:00.560 --> 06:01.460
You're confident.

06:03.040 --> 06:03.700
Ambitions

06:03.800 --> 06:05.020
must be great enough

06:05.800 --> 06:07.370
to make one fight for them a whole lifetime.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.370
For killers like us,

06:10.870 --> 06:13.100
the greatest ambition

06:14.480 --> 06:15.900
is to kill the hardest man to kill.

06:18.310 --> 06:19.660
Interesting.

06:20.240 --> 06:20.900
That

06:21.190 --> 06:22.370
deserves a toast.

06:33.430 --> 06:34.460
I didn't expect

06:35.750 --> 06:36.580
the well-celebrated

06:36.630 --> 06:38.050
Prince of Langya

06:38.750 --> 06:39.580
to be drinking alone

06:39.630 --> 06:41.100
in a tavern.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.540
You're lonely.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.020
I've followed you for a long time.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.700
You have no one around you.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.370
Today,

06:53.800 --> 06:54.730
you deliberately hid

06:54.750 --> 06:56.000
from everyone.

07:00.800 --> 07:01.660
Because you wanted

07:01.720 --> 07:02.660
to see

07:03.560 --> 07:04.540
how Tianqi

07:04.600 --> 07:05.610
or this world would turn out

07:06.240 --> 07:07.900
without you.

07:08.830 --> 07:10.540
Will it remain the same?

07:12.040 --> 07:13.370
Were all your choices

07:13.430 --> 07:15.220
over the years

07:16.390 --> 07:17.490
not worth it?

07:20.000 --> 07:20.930
If you weren't a killer,

07:22.070 --> 07:22.900
I'd love

07:23.240 --> 07:24.850
to have a drink with you.

07:26.270 --> 07:27.050
What a shame.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.410
The world can't go on

07:29.480 --> 07:30.140
without you.

07:31.870 --> 07:33.700
In the light, the people look up to you.

07:35.000 --> 07:36.020
In the shadows,

07:37.430 --> 07:38.540
we're waiting for you.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.900
It's been a long time

07:50.800 --> 07:51.660
since I've had a proper fight

07:52.070 --> 07:53.050
in Tianqi City.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.070
You didn't draw your sword.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.630
Are you trying to stall?

08:10.270 --> 08:12.810
I've forgotten how to draw my sword.

08:13.950 --> 08:14.660
Forgotten?

08:16.240 --> 08:17.450
I once had a sword

08:18.120 --> 08:19.570
called The World's Third.

08:20.390 --> 08:22.100
It was named after my master,

08:22.190 --> 08:23.220
Mr. Li's sword

08:23.560 --> 08:25.100
called The World's Second,

08:25.680 --> 08:26.300
which meant,

08:26.510 --> 08:27.980
"I'm the second in the world.

08:28.270 --> 08:30.540
Who dares claim first?"

08:31.270 --> 08:32.850
Then your World's Third

08:33.390 --> 08:35.420
must've been the greatest swordsmanship

08:36.080 --> 08:37.450
after Mr. Li,

08:38.120 --> 08:39.180
who led the academy.

08:40.510 --> 08:42.450
I honestly should've switched with that brat

08:43.120 --> 08:44.450
for this mission.

08:45.720 --> 08:47.260
But I can't perform that move.

08:48.600 --> 08:49.330
I remember

08:49.910 --> 08:51.180
how joyous it was when I created it

08:51.750 --> 08:53.180
and how heroic it was when I wielded the sword.

08:54.390 --> 08:55.180
But now,

08:55.360 --> 08:56.850
when I lift the sword,

08:57.390 --> 08:59.450
it feels empty.

09:00.030 --> 09:01.090
The Haoque Sword

09:01.840 --> 09:03.020
doesn't answer me.

09:04.440 --> 09:05.850
Haoque?

09:06.750 --> 09:08.180
It's just a sword.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.180
A famed sword

09:13.030 --> 09:13.690
has its own spirit.

09:19.790 --> 09:20.330
No.

09:28.750 --> 09:29.570
Your sword

09:30.200 --> 09:32.020
may be grand enough to embrace everything,

09:32.750 --> 09:33.660
but to me,

09:33.670 --> 09:34.810
it's hollow and pale.

09:35.790 --> 09:37.210
Your sword aura

09:37.390 --> 09:39.020
contains too much benevolence.

09:39.510 --> 09:40.670
It lacks

09:40.670 --> 09:42.090
killing intent that can take someone down.

09:42.790 --> 09:43.660
I don't fear

09:44.510 --> 09:45.260
a sword like that.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.330
Because in everyone's eyes,

09:51.510 --> 09:52.420
this world has never had a place

09:52.440 --> 09:53.610
for me.

10:13.720 --> 10:15.380
Your sword kills the human heart.

10:16.150 --> 10:17.970
It can suppress the wielder's urge.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.570
I'm different.

10:21.120 --> 10:21.930
When I draw my sword,

10:22.790 --> 10:24.020
I draw to kill.

10:24.630 --> 10:25.380
True.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.660
No sword

10:28.440 --> 10:29.660
can really

10:30.200 --> 10:31.450
embrace the whole world, after all.

10:39.150 --> 10:39.850
Sir,

10:40.870 --> 10:42.140
I can't stop her.

10:48.940 --> 10:51.660
[Li Xinyue, Guardian Azure Dragon]

10:53.910 --> 10:55.260
Why are you drinking here alone?

10:56.150 --> 10:56.780
Do you think

10:56.780 --> 10:58.060
you're still that willful prince you once were?

11:00.240 --> 11:01.060
Xinyue.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.180
The Four Guardians of Tianqi,

11:04.000 --> 11:04.850
Guardian Azure Dragon.

11:05.790 --> 11:06.690
I knew

11:07.790 --> 11:09.260
Blood River coming to Tianqi

11:09.260 --> 11:10.260
couldn't mean anything good.

11:10.750 --> 11:12.540
You're not like Su Muyu.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.180
Hanyi told me,

11:14.720 --> 11:16.660
if I see you, don't hesitate.

11:36.200 --> 11:37.930
Heart Sword Rain from Sword Heart Tomb.

11:38.550 --> 11:40.330
Your killing intent is more extreme than mine.

11:41.150 --> 11:41.930
Looks like

11:41.930 --> 11:43.450
my Heart Sword Rain isn't fierce enough

11:43.790 --> 11:45.450
to shut your mouth.

12:06.510 --> 12:07.020
Break.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.060
It's you.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.300
Yes.

12:34.630 --> 12:35.300
It's me.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.930
Even if you came, it wouldn't help.

12:46.240 --> 12:47.300
This is bad.

12:48.790 --> 12:49.730
It's been a long time,

12:50.240 --> 12:51.210
Mr. Su Zhe.

12:52.870 --> 12:54.140
You have a good memory, Your Highness.

12:54.480 --> 12:55.300
You remember me.

12:56.600 --> 12:57.420
Death-Chasing Bell.

12:57.960 --> 12:58.810
Life-Seizing Rings.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.780
I wouldn't dare forget.

13:01.670 --> 13:03.450
I'm no longer part of Blood River.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.260
Spare our lives.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.660
What do you say?

13:08.600 --> 13:11.300
Back then, when I was escorting the Marquis of Zhenxi,

13:12.200 --> 13:13.930
someone paid Blood River a hefty price

13:14.080 --> 13:14.970
for my life.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.850
Even though Mr. Su Zhe

13:17.120 --> 13:19.090
had the upper hand,

13:19.360 --> 13:20.450
he spared us.

13:23.030 --> 13:23.850
Xinyue,

13:24.750 --> 13:25.900
please let Mr. Su leave.

13:27.510 --> 13:28.380
If we let them go,

13:28.630 --> 13:29.420
it'll cause endless trouble.

13:31.390 --> 13:32.260
Must we fight?

13:34.630 --> 13:35.380
Xinyue,

13:36.390 --> 13:37.610
please let Mr. Su leave.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.970
Su Muyu can't cook,

13:50.720 --> 13:51.810
but he's good at picking pastry.

13:53.550 --> 13:54.610
This is nice.

13:59.720 --> 14:00.660
I wonder

14:01.120 --> 14:03.140
if the Shadow Sect treated him well.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.090
Did they feed him bran and scraps

14:05.390 --> 14:06.610
like a prisoner?

14:11.390 --> 14:12.450
What happened to them?

14:21.440 --> 14:22.380
What's going on?

14:23.360 --> 14:23.930
Save them first.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.500
We'll talk later.

14:25.910 --> 14:27.180
Both of them look like they're about to die.

14:27.180 --> 14:27.930
Who do I save first?

14:28.270 --> 14:29.450
Save the Patriarch.

14:30.000 --> 14:30.610
I'm fine.

14:31.910 --> 14:32.380
No.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.210
I... I can still hold on.

14:36.630 --> 14:37.570
Not pretending this time?

14:38.440 --> 14:39.570
It's not that.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.330
I almost died.

14:41.790 --> 14:42.930
I just played dead.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.570
When she saw I wasn't a threat,

14:44.910 --> 14:45.930
she spared me.

14:46.550 --> 14:48.690
That's why I'm not badly hurt.

14:49.240 --> 14:49.810
Unlike the Patriarch.

14:50.720 --> 14:51.850
He was struck

14:52.670 --> 14:53.970
by the sword rain.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.020
Shut up.

14:57.840 --> 14:58.730
Who did you run into?

14:59.360 --> 15:00.850
This is terrifying.

15:01.360 --> 15:02.570
Guardian Azure Dragon of Tianqi,

15:03.030 --> 15:04.090
the heir to Heart Sword.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.610
I'll try to stop the bleeding.

15:15.910 --> 15:17.380
Piece of work.

15:21.320 --> 15:22.730
I'm in bad shape.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.690
Why are you still insulting me, Miss Bai?

15:31.630 --> 15:32.420
Apply this medicine

15:33.000 --> 15:34.690
all over Su Changhe.

15:35.000 --> 15:35.730
Three times a day.

15:36.360 --> 15:37.540
Get more from me when you run out.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.090
This will do?

15:42.670 --> 15:43.210
I'd say

15:43.210 --> 15:44.210
it's a waste to use it on him.

15:46.840 --> 15:47.690
Spill it.

15:48.000 --> 15:49.260
What are you plotting this time?

15:49.790 --> 15:51.540
You made yourself look so pitiful.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.850
It's frightening,

15:53.000 --> 15:53.730
but

15:53.730 --> 15:54.930
there's no inner injury at all.

15:56.630 --> 15:58.300
You're putting on an act.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.260
I heard you failed to kill Prince of Langya.

16:19.720 --> 16:20.930
We were about to succeed,

16:21.630 --> 16:23.380
but Li Xinyue, Guardian Azure Dragon, arrived suddenly.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.420
Why didn't you stop her?

16:25.870 --> 16:27.500
I didn't know you'd strike

16:27.500 --> 16:29.300
at Diaolou Cottage.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.060
Nonsense.

16:33.270 --> 16:34.330
Opportunities vanish in the blink of an eye.

16:34.870 --> 16:36.420
How could we possibly have time to inform you?

16:37.120 --> 16:37.780
Besides,

16:38.320 --> 16:39.930
the Shadow Sect has spies all over the city.

16:40.440 --> 16:41.900
We sent signals,

16:42.150 --> 16:43.420
how did you not know?

16:44.030 --> 16:45.660
Yet Li Xinyue got there before you.

16:49.390 --> 16:50.330
I'm telling you,

16:51.240 --> 16:52.610
if our Patriarch dies,

16:53.200 --> 16:54.810
I'll lead the entire Blood River

16:55.360 --> 16:56.660
to fight you to death.

16:57.510 --> 16:59.380
You're gravely injured now.

17:00.030 --> 17:02.090
Will there be another chance?

17:03.080 --> 17:04.570
We missed this one.

17:05.590 --> 17:06.460
Prince of Langya

17:06.460 --> 17:08.130
will definitely increase his guards.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.020
It'll be much harder

17:10.510 --> 17:11.500
to kill him a second time.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.130
Right.

17:14.350 --> 17:15.570
In many cases,

17:16.790 --> 17:18.570
you only get one chance.

17:19.000 --> 17:19.500
No.

17:20.880 --> 17:21.780
There still is.

17:24.350 --> 17:25.610
What do you plan to do, Sir?

17:26.960 --> 17:29.460
I'll gather all Blood River elites from the Three Families and enter Tianqi

17:29.830 --> 17:30.890
to kill him.

17:32.720 --> 17:34.370
The Blood River elites enter Tianqi?

17:39.550 --> 17:40.330
Believe me.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.370
No one will notice.

17:42.790 --> 17:44.170
By the time they do,

17:44.350 --> 17:45.410
they'll already be dead.

17:46.510 --> 17:48.330
I've shown my sincerity.

17:48.830 --> 17:49.700
I hope Sect Leader Yi

17:49.700 --> 17:50.740
will show his

17:51.550 --> 17:52.890
by sending enough men

17:52.920 --> 17:53.780
to help.

18:04.790 --> 18:05.410
All right.

18:19.480 --> 18:20.980
I see your plan.

18:23.790 --> 18:24.780
Even though Su Muyu

18:25.070 --> 18:25.570
and you

18:26.160 --> 18:27.410
are powerful,

18:27.830 --> 18:29.810
once you enter the vast Tianqi City,

18:30.270 --> 18:31.740
you're like a pebble

18:31.960 --> 18:33.060
dropped into a pond.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.060
But if an army of demons

18:35.060 --> 18:36.370
with swords

18:36.400 --> 18:37.410
enters Tianqi,

18:37.880 --> 18:39.170
it'll be like countless pebbles

18:39.310 --> 18:40.460
thrown into the pond,

18:40.920 --> 18:43.130
stirring up huge waves.

18:45.920 --> 18:46.980
Yi Bu won't refuse.

18:49.510 --> 18:51.570
He has no reason to.

18:53.830 --> 18:55.300
You're indeed

18:56.270 --> 18:56.980
a piece of work.

19:07.000 --> 19:07.610
Sir,

19:08.680 --> 19:10.130
I met with Su Changhe today.

19:10.680 --> 19:11.610
They planned an assassination

19:11.610 --> 19:12.780
of Prince of Langya

19:13.400 --> 19:14.570
and nearly succeeded.

19:24.070 --> 19:25.780
Nearly succeeded?

19:27.000 --> 19:28.610
So they yet to succeed?

19:29.200 --> 19:29.810
Yes, sir.

19:30.550 --> 19:31.700
The mission failed,

19:32.720 --> 19:34.020
and Su Changhe is seriously injured.

19:34.510 --> 19:35.300
But at the same time,

19:35.880 --> 19:37.780
he swore enmity against Prince of Langya.

19:39.030 --> 19:40.940
He asks to rally all Blood River elites

19:41.790 --> 19:42.740
to enter Tianqi City.

19:48.510 --> 19:50.260
All Blood River elites?

19:51.880 --> 19:53.170
If anything goes wrong,

19:54.110 --> 19:55.410
Tianqi City will be plunged

19:55.440 --> 19:56.460
into horrific chaos.

19:57.240 --> 19:57.980
Sir,

19:58.960 --> 20:00.020
are you suggesting

20:00.680 --> 20:01.850
we stop Su Changhe?

20:04.240 --> 20:05.020
No.

20:06.310 --> 20:07.370
Give him the approval.

20:09.550 --> 20:11.650
As long as Su Muyu is under my control,

20:13.400 --> 20:15.260
I bet he won't act recklessly.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.540
It seems Drunken Dream Bone

20:26.030 --> 20:27.740
does more than strip one of their martial skills,

20:29.310 --> 20:30.650
it also sends them

20:30.880 --> 20:32.300
into a strange trance.

20:47.070 --> 20:48.570
I thought I was the only one in this prison.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.610
You must've been poisoned

20:51.110 --> 20:52.300
and can't use your inner force, right?

20:53.070 --> 20:53.650
Otherwise,

20:54.000 --> 20:55.090
you would've sensed

20:55.090 --> 20:55.890
my presence a long time ago.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.300
Yes.

20:58.110 --> 20:58.850
I've been poisoned.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.370
What's your name?

21:03.240 --> 21:04.260
I'm Su Muyu, sir.

21:04.750 --> 21:06.060
Su Muyu.

21:06.590 --> 21:08.220
That's a nice name.

21:15.270 --> 21:16.500
How should I address you, sir?

21:17.270 --> 21:18.220
My surname is Zhuo.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.170
Zhuo?

21:24.790 --> 21:26.810
Why are you imprisoned here?

21:27.750 --> 21:28.780
Someone wanted to use me,

21:30.240 --> 21:31.330
someone wanted to kill me,

21:33.510 --> 21:34.540
someone wanted to save me,

21:35.200 --> 21:36.300
and I ended up here.

21:36.880 --> 21:37.890
All because of what others wanted.

21:38.510 --> 21:39.780
What about you?

21:47.240 --> 21:47.940
Yue'an,

21:48.350 --> 21:49.020
live on.

21:49.510 --> 21:50.850
When you grow up, become a sword deity

21:51.110 --> 21:52.300
and rebuild No-Sword City.

22:03.350 --> 22:04.060
Father.

22:05.070 --> 22:05.980
Take care.

22:07.270 --> 22:08.060
Father.

22:12.510 --> 22:13.220
Father.

22:16.110 --> 22:16.890
Father.

22:23.240 --> 22:23.940
Father.

22:27.070 --> 22:27.890
Father!

22:29.920 --> 22:30.610
Father!

22:47.790 --> 22:48.940
I'm seeking an answer.

22:50.350 --> 22:51.220
What answer?

22:52.880 --> 22:54.650
Something I have to know.

22:55.640 --> 22:56.810
If it's something you must know,

22:57.160 --> 22:58.460
why haven't you found it

22:58.830 --> 23:00.130
after all these years?

23:00.880 --> 23:01.540
Because

23:01.540 --> 23:02.570
once I know the answer,

23:04.550 --> 23:06.060
there's something I must do.

23:08.310 --> 23:09.170
Something I couldn't do

23:11.110 --> 23:11.940
back then.

23:13.350 --> 23:14.890
Back then, you say?

23:15.510 --> 23:17.090
I believe it won't be long before I can.

23:18.240 --> 23:18.810
But first,

23:19.110 --> 23:20.300
you need to get out of here.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.300
It's said that in the Shadow Sect's prison,

23:22.880 --> 23:23.850
people die,

23:24.440 --> 23:25.570
no one ever leaves alive.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.370
My friend will come to save me.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.570
Someone from Blood River

23:30.440 --> 23:31.330
actually call another person

23:31.550 --> 23:32.610
a friend?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.780
You're different.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.300
What if he never comes?

23:38.790 --> 23:39.980
Then I'll take the chance

23:40.550 --> 23:41.540
to rest.

23:42.400 --> 23:44.260
You don't seem wary of me at all.

23:44.590 --> 23:46.170
You're telling me everything.

23:47.350 --> 23:48.220
Because

23:49.000 --> 23:49.740
your surname is Zhuo, sir.

23:50.590 --> 23:51.980
Just because of a surname?

23:52.550 --> 23:53.300
Yes.

23:55.270 --> 23:56.460
Because my father's

23:58.310 --> 23:59.090
surname is Zhuo.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.020
I know it's you.

24:16.350 --> 24:17.090
Father.

24:17.920 --> 24:18.570
Yue'an,

24:19.200 --> 24:20.130
you don't seem surprised

24:20.720 --> 24:22.020
to see me again.

24:23.110 --> 24:24.220
Drunken Dream Bone

24:24.880 --> 24:26.170
sends one into a drunken dream.

24:28.030 --> 24:29.130
I'd already guessed as much.

24:31.000 --> 24:32.780
Even if all this is just an illusion,

24:33.350 --> 24:34.270
I still can't help

24:34.270 --> 24:35.700
but want to talk with you.

24:37.960 --> 24:38.650
Yue'an,

24:39.400 --> 24:40.220
you've suffered

24:40.880 --> 24:41.740
all these years.

24:42.570 --> 24:43.410
Father,

24:45.480 --> 24:46.330
I'll find the one behind

24:46.350 --> 24:48.130
the fall of No-Sword City

24:48.750 --> 24:49.370
and restore

24:49.400 --> 24:51.060
the honor that was once ours.

24:52.070 --> 24:53.540
How have you been all this time?

24:55.070 --> 24:56.300
It must've been tough

24:57.350 --> 24:58.780
coming this far alone.

24:59.550 --> 25:00.850
Not entirely.

25:01.960 --> 25:02.700
All these years,

25:03.240 --> 25:04.740
I've had my friends by my side.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.850
Drunken Dream Bone

25:14.750 --> 25:16.170
is acting up.

25:25.590 --> 25:26.060
Yue'an,

25:26.720 --> 25:27.780
I've always believed

25:28.550 --> 25:29.780
you'll bring No-Sword City

25:30.070 --> 25:31.060
back into the martial world.

25:31.790 --> 25:32.700
But more than that,

25:33.270 --> 25:34.370
knowing you've had friends by your side

25:34.640 --> 25:36.260
all these years

25:37.160 --> 25:38.570
brings my heart peace.

25:41.350 --> 25:42.170
Father.

26:12.070 --> 26:12.850
Something feels wrong here.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.610
It's barely night,

26:14.830 --> 26:16.090
and there's not a soul on this street.

26:20.070 --> 26:20.810
Why are you smiling?

26:23.510 --> 26:24.810
It's the Chinese New Year's Eve.

26:25.880 --> 26:27.130
Naturally, the streets are empty.

26:28.510 --> 26:30.260
Even the usually busiest vendors

26:30.260 --> 26:31.370
have gone home.

26:31.880 --> 26:33.020
What's so surprising about that?

26:36.510 --> 26:37.780
It's the Chinese New Year's Eve today?

26:43.880 --> 26:44.780
Smells great.

26:45.480 --> 26:46.410
It really does.

26:47.550 --> 26:48.260
What's that?

26:50.240 --> 26:51.300
It smells like fried tofu.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.220
It's a kind of dish

26:53.350 --> 26:54.460
common folk make for the Chinese New Year.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.570
They use puffy tofu

26:57.070 --> 26:57.980
and deep-fry it.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.020
For rich households,

27:00.400 --> 27:01.810
they stuff them with meat.

27:03.750 --> 27:04.610
I want to try some.

27:06.070 --> 27:06.810
Go grab a few.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.500
Chinese New Year's Eve

27:10.350 --> 27:11.510
is one of the few good days in the year

27:11.510 --> 27:13.220
for the poor.

27:14.310 --> 27:15.370
Don't cause them trouble

27:15.400 --> 27:16.540
on a day like this.

27:17.310 --> 27:18.090
Fine.

27:20.830 --> 27:23.090
Did you look forward to the Chinese New Year when you were a kid?

27:24.240 --> 27:25.060
Of course.

27:26.550 --> 27:27.780
It was

27:28.350 --> 27:29.260
one of the rare good days

27:29.920 --> 27:31.220
of the year.

27:32.310 --> 27:33.170
No matter how many troubles

27:33.200 --> 27:34.130
the past year brought,

27:35.830 --> 27:36.890
when the new year began,

27:36.960 --> 27:37.810
all those worries

27:38.400 --> 27:39.330
seemed to disappear.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.330
Everyone

27:42.350 --> 27:43.330
ate happily,

27:45.030 --> 27:46.410
and when dawn broke,

27:47.680 --> 27:49.090
everything started anew.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.650
You sound so bookish.

27:53.400 --> 27:54.330
I heard people say

27:54.790 --> 27:56.090
they like the Chinese New Year

27:56.350 --> 27:57.700
because it's the only time

27:57.700 --> 27:58.980
they get to eat

27:59.160 --> 28:00.410
what they usually can't afford.

28:03.440 --> 28:05.260
That's true for ordinary families.

28:05.920 --> 28:07.650
When I was a kid, we were quite well off.

28:08.480 --> 28:10.090
So I never really felt that way.

28:10.750 --> 28:11.610
I forgot

28:12.440 --> 28:13.300
you were born

28:13.310 --> 28:14.500
with a silver spoon.

28:25.790 --> 28:26.890
You've never celebrated the Chinese New Year?

28:33.640 --> 28:34.740
As far back as I can remember,

28:35.070 --> 28:36.570
my brother and I were always wandering.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.090
Later, we joined Blood River.

28:39.640 --> 28:40.500
There's no such thing

28:40.510 --> 28:41.570
as a celebration there.

28:41.590 --> 28:42.300
So

28:45.790 --> 28:46.810
I've never had one.

28:54.160 --> 28:54.810
It's a shame

28:54.830 --> 28:56.260
no taverns are open today.

28:56.960 --> 28:58.220
Otherwise, I'd buy you a drink.

28:59.200 --> 29:00.020
Jeez.

29:07.400 --> 29:09.260
Who's there?

29:12.070 --> 29:12.940
Don't be afraid, madam.

29:13.400 --> 29:14.500
We're just travelers passing through.

29:14.830 --> 29:15.810
We'll rest a while

29:16.240 --> 29:17.020
and be on our way.

29:19.790 --> 29:21.040
It's the Chinese New Year.

29:21.040 --> 29:22.500
You're still traveling?

29:23.640 --> 29:24.170
Yes.

29:24.880 --> 29:25.810
We had something to attend to

29:25.960 --> 29:26.810
and got delayed.

29:27.510 --> 29:28.130
Changhe,

29:28.270 --> 29:28.810
let's go.

29:31.790 --> 29:32.500
Sons.

29:34.790 --> 29:36.220
On Chinese New Year's Eve,

29:37.310 --> 29:39.220
only inns in big cities

29:39.270 --> 29:40.300
stay open.

29:40.830 --> 29:42.060
The nearest big city

29:42.550 --> 29:45.020
is eight to ten hours away.

29:45.480 --> 29:46.170
Why don't you

29:46.510 --> 29:48.810
come have dinner at my place?

29:53.030 --> 29:53.780
Sons,

29:54.790 --> 29:55.890
please.

29:56.350 --> 29:58.540
I beg you to keep an old woman company.

29:58.830 --> 30:00.370
Come have dinner.

30:04.440 --> 30:04.890
Alright.

30:07.110 --> 30:07.810
Come on.

30:36.790 --> 30:37.570
Have some tea.

30:39.350 --> 30:40.810
Have a seat.

30:40.880 --> 30:42.610
I'll make you a meal.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.300
Sit. Make yourselves at home.

30:47.960 --> 30:48.890
Aren't you worried it's a trap?

30:50.590 --> 30:51.260
I'm not.

30:51.960 --> 30:52.570
Are you afraid?

30:53.240 --> 30:54.220
How can it be?

31:13.200 --> 31:14.460
Smells like fried tofu.

31:17.030 --> 31:18.320
Dinner's ready.

31:21.920 --> 31:22.980
On a day like this,

31:23.160 --> 31:24.370
everyone should sit down

31:24.720 --> 31:26.330
and eat a bowl of steaming rice.

31:29.070 --> 31:29.700
Are you

31:30.310 --> 31:31.500
still traveling?

31:33.750 --> 31:35.060
If your parents knew

31:35.590 --> 31:37.810
you had nowhere

31:38.110 --> 31:40.020
to stay tonight,

31:40.590 --> 31:42.090
they'd be heartbroken.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.090
This fried tofu smells amazing.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.460
I could eat

31:51.030 --> 31:52.300
a whole bowl of rice.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.650
Are you all right, madam?

32:10.200 --> 32:11.710
My Yuanxu

32:12.440 --> 32:14.410
used to say the same thing.

32:17.350 --> 32:18.640
He loved

32:19.030 --> 32:21.650
my fried tofu.

32:28.160 --> 32:28.940
I'm sorry.

32:31.750 --> 32:32.570
It's fine.

32:34.270 --> 32:36.410
He promised to return after the war

32:36.790 --> 32:38.170
for the Chinese New Year.

32:38.790 --> 32:39.700
Just now,

32:41.070 --> 32:42.940
I heard a noise outside

32:44.270 --> 32:46.650
and thought it might be his companions

32:47.030 --> 32:49.810
bringing wrong news.

32:50.640 --> 32:51.410
I thought

32:52.480 --> 32:53.850
he'd come back.

32:54.350 --> 32:55.330
I didn't expect

32:55.920 --> 32:57.260
to see you instead.

33:01.310 --> 33:02.220
I'll take you

33:03.640 --> 33:06.260
as those he sent

33:07.070 --> 33:09.460
to spend the Chinese New Year with me.

33:19.680 --> 33:21.060
Alright, enough talk.

33:23.550 --> 33:24.980
Eat first.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.130
I'll fry you

33:27.640 --> 33:28.700
some eggs.

33:42.070 --> 33:42.890
Sit.

33:46.400 --> 33:47.890
It's a kind gesture from the old lady.

33:48.790 --> 33:49.540
Go on, try it.

34:04.160 --> 34:05.370
The fried tofu is delicious.

34:09.280 --> 34:10.460
But it's different from what you said.

34:12.320 --> 34:14.690
This old lady may be poor,

34:15.400 --> 34:16.770
but she added some meat.

34:19.440 --> 34:21.170
She saved this for her child.

34:24.480 --> 34:25.820
Even after they told her

34:27.110 --> 34:28.540
he was dead,

34:29.880 --> 34:31.340
she still holds hope.

34:36.590 --> 34:37.980
This is my first reunion dinner

34:39.400 --> 34:40.570
in my life.

34:48.320 --> 34:48.900
Madam,

34:49.590 --> 34:50.610
come eat with us.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.090
What generosity.

35:52.920 --> 35:53.820
Who'd have thought

35:54.800 --> 35:57.030
Su Muyu, famed for his good reputation,

35:57.030 --> 35:58.020
would leave nothing behind,

35:58.280 --> 36:00.250
yet the ruthless Undertaker

36:01.070 --> 36:01.980
left a silver ingot.

36:06.400 --> 36:07.900
I put five copper coins here

36:07.900 --> 36:08.770
after the meal.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.460
Only five?

36:13.150 --> 36:14.730
That's all I have.

36:16.630 --> 36:17.460
Pauper.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.250
Let's go.

36:48.460 --> 36:51.140
♪Just one line♪

36:51.220 --> 36:57.460
♪All grudges and storms ended with you...♪

36:59.880 --> 37:00.770
Su Muyu,

37:02.110 --> 37:03.020
Happy Chinese New Year's Eve.

37:05.060 --> 37:08.420
♪I'm lucky to meet you♪

37:09.700 --> 37:13.180
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:13.220 --> 37:17.100
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:18.940 --> 37:22.420
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:22.460 --> 37:26.300
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:28.300 --> 37:31.580
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:31.700 --> 37:33.780
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:33.940 --> 37:37.380
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:37.860 --> 37:40.060
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:40.180 --> 37:45.180
♪No one can escape from love♪

38:01.780 --> 38:05.500
♪How many hidden feelings♪

38:05.620 --> 38:09.700
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

38:10.940 --> 38:14.820
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

38:14.940 --> 38:19.180
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

38:20.300 --> 38:23.180
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

38:23.260 --> 38:27.500
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

38:29.780 --> 38:33.780
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

38:33.820 --> 38:37.260
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

38:38.780 --> 38:42.220
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

38:42.300 --> 38:46.100
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

38:48.020 --> 38:51.460
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

38:51.500 --> 38:55.340
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

38:57.380 --> 39:00.620
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

39:00.740 --> 39:02.820
♪Still I can't let go♪

39:03.020 --> 39:06.420
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

39:06.900 --> 39:09.100
♪My heart no longer my own♪

39:09.180 --> 39:14.220
♪No one can escape from love♪

